OL,3,GNEWSACourt system under massive strain,
OL,4,Awarns Met chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police has
OL,7,Fsaid that in 40 years of policing he
OL,8,Fhas never seen so much strain on the
OL,9,Fcriminal justice system.
OL,11,FSir Mark Rowley said this "massive
OL,12,Fstrain" was due to years of funding
OL,13,Fpressures and backlogs that built up
OL,14,Fduring the Covid pandemic.
OL,16,FSpeaking to BBC Radio 4's PM programme
OL,17,FSir Mark said: "In London we've got
OL,18,Fnearly 500 cases listed for trial in
OL,19,F2030."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
