OL,3,GNEWSACourt system under massive strain,
OL,4,Awarns Met chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, the government said it had
OL,7,Ftaken action "to keep more of the most
OL,8,Fserious criminals locked up" and more
OL,9,Fprison spaces were being built. The
OL,10,FCrown Prosecution Service (CPS) said
OL,11,Fits prosecutors were set to receive
OL,12,Fmore support working in remand courts
OL,13,Fplus extra training.
